            "review_title": "Review at El Gaucho | Nhà Thờ Lớn Hà Nội",
            "review_text": "Erin\nKuwait City, Kuwait64 contributions\n0\nMust go if you're in town\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe absolutely love this restaurant. The food is excellent, the service is spectacular, the views are beautiful, and the atmosphere is chill. You can come dressed up, dressed down, with friends, family, or by yourself. The location is within walking distance from where we live, but they have several locations in Hanoi and one in Saigon. They also have locations in Thailand, Prague, and Bratislava. For being a franchise, you'd never know.\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2026",
