            "review_text": "סופיה א\n4 contributions\n0\nPerfect experience – excellent food, rare service and personality of heart Add some photos Optional Add photos I certify that this revi\nMay 2026 • Couples\nWe ate 3 pairs, a perfect evening at El Gaucho Tràng Tiền. From the moment we entered we received exceptional service – professional, kind and with real attention to every detail.\n\nThe food was of a very high standard—the meat was high-quality and spicy, made exactly as it should, and every dish that came to the table was excellent. I ate gluten-free, and I had so much pleasure feeling awareness, listening and fully adapted.\n\nA combination of excellent food, excellent service, great atmosphere and perfect personality. Definitely one of our best meals in Vietnam — highly recommended! ✨\nRead more\nTranslated from Hebrew\nShow original\nWritten May 26, 2026",
